                                "sense_id": "230fb094-8850-37bb-8fb9-6be80913f795",
                                "text": "And there, unpent by mountains, one saw the sky—the sky, not such a disc as one saw it here, but an arch of immeasurable blue, a deep of deeps in which the circling stars were floating..."
